**Issue**: #420
**Date**: 2026-09-24
**Status**: Approved
**Author**: NMG

Feature: Collect durable host review receipts without aborting siblings
  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: Delayed host result survives worker-idle observation
    Given three reviewers with exact assignments are running in the current tab
    And one reviewer becomes idle before its valid host result receipt is durable
    When the controller collects review evidence
    Then it waits for all sibling settlements before closing any pane
    And one bounded observation recheck accepts the eventual valid host result only

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: Persistently unsafe review evidence stays blocked
    Given a reviewer receipt remains malformed, foreign, contaminated, absent or empty after the bounded recheck
    When the controller validates review scope
    Then it fails without fabricating a result from terminal or tool text
    And it does not publish a passed review handoff

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: Retained failed smoke is not replayed unchanged
    Given smoke issue #129 stopped review1 with original failed checkpoint and retained artifacts
    When a corrected collector is available
    Then a changed-hypothesis attempt occurs only if exact owner, head and one-use recovery prove eligibility
    And otherwise the existing failure is reported without a new workspace, tab or replacement issue
